title: VISO_Intro
---
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]You're doing well, kiddo! I'm proud of you![/Fo]
-> I am honored to receive your praise.
-> Really? I thought I did about average.
-> Fuck off. I like you less than the other voices.
    The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Woah woah [b]woah[/b] there, champ! Remember whose head you're inside of![/Fo]
    The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]I'll give you a hint: It's not yours.[/Fo]
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Look, kid. There's a lotta guys who'll try and screw you over! [/Fo]
Empathy:[Em]But must it?[/Em]
Force:[Fo]Of course.[/Fo]
Insight:[In]Perhaps... I'll reserve judgement until we know more.[/In]
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]There's no need! This country was founded by experts.[/Fo]
